{
  "machine": "sce:std/shared/record_list",
  "about": "A change to the standard shared record list (sce:std/shared/record_list.scxml) is one unit (docs/adr/0046): a person stages the commands of a change with `more`, and the command that ends it closes it, when the change is judged whole, stamped once, taken in at once, and sent as one change of as many parts, each carrying `parts` and a write-over the change's stamp. A change one of whose commands is refused is refused whole. A copy holds the parts of a change until it holds them all, and takes them in together; a part it holds already is not held again and takes the rest of its change in with it; a resync takes in every part held. The hub passes each part on as it comes and takes the change in whole. Expected values come from a model of the list, not from a backend.",
  "steps": [
    {"note": "started: a copy that holds nothing", "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"node": "0", "values": []}}},
    {"note": "the host names the copy: node 1, a person's copy", "event": "record_list.join", "data": {"node": "1", "hub": false}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"node": "1", "hub": false}}},
    {"note": "the first command of a change says it goes on: it is held, and nothing is stamped, sent or taken in", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "now": "1727000100000", "more": true}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [], "clock": {"wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}}}},
    {"note": "so is the second", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 2, "value": "3", "text": "", "now": "1727000100000", "more": true}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [], "clock": {"wallTime": "0", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "0"}}}},
    {"note": "the third ends the change: three fields of one row taken in at one stamp, and sent to the hub as one change of three parts", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 3, "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "now": "1727000100000"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#hub", "event": "record_list.write", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1", "parts": 3}}, {"target": "#hub", "event": "record_list.write", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 2, "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1", "parts": 3}}, {"target": "#hub", "event": "record_list.write", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 3, "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1", "parts": 3}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}}}},
    {"note": "a change that writes one field over and gives the row a fourth begins", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "call home", "more": true, "now": "1727000101000"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call the clinic", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}]}}},
    {"note": "and ends: the value it saw written over, then both writes, every part at the change's stamp", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 4, "value": "9", "text": "", "now": "1727000101000"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#hub", "event": "record_list.supersede", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 1, "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1", "by": "1", "parts": 3, "atWallTime": "1727000101000", "atCounter": 0}}, {"target": "#hub", "event": "record_list.write", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1", "parts": 3}}, {"target": "#hub", "event": "record_list.write", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 4, "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1", "parts": 3}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "tombstones": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}}}},
    {"note": "a change begins on another row", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 6, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "ok", "more": true, "now": "1727000102000"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}]}}},
    {"note": "its second command carries a text one byte past what a person writes: the change is refused whole, its first field with it", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 6, "field": 2, "value": "0", "text": "a note that is one byte past it!!", "now": "1727000102000"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 1}}},
    {"note": "a change that names one register twice begins", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 6, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "a", "more": true, "now": "1727000102000"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}]}}},
    {"note": "and is refused whole when it ends: the order of its commands means nothing", "event": "record_list.edit", "data": {"id": 6, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "b", "now": "1727000102000"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, "refusals": 1}}},
    {"note": "another person's change of two fields arrives a part at a time: the first is held, and nothing of it is taken in", "event": "record_list.write", "data": {"id": 7, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2", "parts": 2}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}}}},
    {"note": "the second makes it whole: both fields are taken in together", "event": "record_list.write", "data": {"id": 7, "field": 2, "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2", "parts": 2}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "7", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "7", "field": "2", "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 2, "nodeId": "1"}}}},
    {"note": "a change of his that writes over the fourth field arrives with its write-over first: held, the field still holds its value", "event": "record_list.supersede", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 4, "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1", "by": "2", "parts": 2, "atWallTime": "1727000104000", "atCounter": 0}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "9", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "7", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "7", "field": "2", "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "tombstones": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}]}}},
    {"note": "its write makes it whole: the value is replaced at once, never empty between the two", "event": "record_list.write", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 4, "value": "10", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2", "parts": 2}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "7", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "7", "field": "2", "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "10", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}], "tombstones": [{"element": "327681", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"element": "327684", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}], "clock": {"wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 2, "nodeId": "1"}}}},
    {"note": "the hub passes a part of the copy's own change back to it: the copy holds it already, and nothing changes", "event": "record_list.write", "data": {"id": 5, "field": 3, "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1", "parts": 3}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "7", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "7", "field": "2", "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "10", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}]}}},
    {"note": "a part of another change arrives and is held", "event": "record_list.write", "data": {"id": 10, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "one", "wallTime": "1727000105000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2", "parts": 2}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "7", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "7", "field": "2", "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "10", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}]}}},
    {"note": "the other part arrives alone, as a peer's walk shares it: it is taken in alone", "event": "record_list.write", "data": {"id": 10, "field": 2, "value": "0", "text": "two", "wallTime": "1727000105000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "7", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "7", "field": "2", "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "10", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "10", "field": "2", "value": "0", "text": "two", "wallTime": "1727000105000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}]}}},
    {"note": "when that part arrives as a part as well, the copy holds it already: the change reached it in pieces, and the part held is taken in at once", "event": "record_list.write", "data": {"id": 10, "field": 2, "value": "0", "text": "two", "wallTime": "1727000105000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2", "parts": 2}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "7", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "7", "field": "2", "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "10", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "10", "field": "2", "value": "0", "text": "two", "wallTime": "1727000105000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "10", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "one", "wallTime": "1727000105000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}]}}},
    {"note": "a part of a change whose other part a link lost is held", "event": "record_list.write", "data": {"id": 11, "field": 1, "value": "0", "text": "half", "wallTime": "1727000106000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "3", "parts": 2}, "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "7", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "7", "field": "2", "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "10", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "10", "field": "2", "value": "0", "text": "two", "wallTime": "1727000105000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "10", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "one", "wallTime": "1727000105000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}]}}},
    {"note": "the link is back: the part held is taken in alone, and the copy shows the hub the root of its digest", "event": "record_list.resync", "expect": {"state": "open", "sent": [{"target": "#hub", "event": "record_list.node", "data": {"sender": "1", "to": 0, "depth": 0, "prefix": "0", "hash": 3348383774, "reply": false}}], "variables": {"values": [{"id": "5", "field": "2", "value": "3", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "3", "value": "0", "text": "before noon", "wallTime": "1727000100000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "5", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "call home", "wallTime": "1727000101000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "1"}, {"id": "7", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "from bob", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "7", "field": "2", "value": "1", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000103000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "5", "field": "4", "value": "10", "text": "", "wallTime": "1727000104000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "10", "field": "2", "value": "0", "text": "two", "wallTime": "1727000105000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "10", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "one", "wallTime": "1727000105000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "2"}, {"id": "11", "field": "1", "value": "0", "text": "half", "wallTime": "1727000106000", "counter": 0, "nodeId": "3"}]}}},
